	"data": "Buckets Finance App\n\nConcept: React PWA that visualizes budget as liquid filling buckets from a faucet. PostgreSQL on Optiplex as source of truth. Calcifer parses card screenshots → inserts transactions → app visualizes.\n\nOrigin: Chris's handwritten design, Sept 24 2026. Money as flowing energy — faucet fills per-paycheck buckets (gas, food, subscriptions), wishlist buckets (devices, trips), and a deep savings pool (investments/retirement) with goal lines.\n\nSpec:…",
